# Shell scripts in this repo run on Linux — cloud-init user-data, the agent
# container entrypoint, the EC2 env generator. A CRLF checkout on Windows makes
# the shebang `#!/bin/bash\r`, which fails with an unreadable "no such file or
# directory". Pin them to LF regardless of core.autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# PowerShell is the Windows side of the same toolchain; leave it CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
